after: head 19d8e75ad93cf5ca59eafcb6f58a786883b9783f => inputWindow=1048576, resolvedWindow=1048576
negative-control: missingWindowFallback=200000, syntheticWindowFallback=200000
```

- The PR adds a separate `config/test-lines-allocations/pr-195319.txt` allocation for its 32 regression-test lines; the shared baseline remains unchanged. `pnpm check:test-lines-ratchet` passed at 6,587,335 lines and an equal effective ceiling.
