- The regression and proof use a synthetic resolver input. They do not prove live provider discovery, Muse's effective window, Muse history transfer, or upgrade behavior.

Canonical contract: `docs/plugins/sdk-provider-plugins/model-catalogs.md` distinguishes provider-reported windows from generated estimates.

