To connect a released seed to the Gateway as in the recorded delivery:

1. Create a seed configuration using a fresh run name and `baseRoot` equal to the released checkout; run `node run.mjs seed.json gateway-seed`. It creates `runs/<seedRun>/gateway-input.sqlite` and `gateway-seed.json`.
