## TipTap / ProseMirror JSON → ODT

```javascript
import { tiptapToOdt } from "odf-kit";

// editor.getJSON() returns TipTap JSONContent
const bytes = await tiptapToOdt(editor.getJSON(), {
  pageFormat: "A4",
